100 READA$:L=LEN(A$):V=VAL(A$):IFL<>1ANDV=0THEN140ELSEIFV<>0ANDV<1000THENP=VELSEIFV<>0ANDV>=1000THEND=VELSEIFA$="U"THENM$="U.S. NEWS"ELSEIFA$="N"THENM$="NEWSWEEK"ELSEIFA$="T"THENM$="TIME"ELSEIFA$="D"THENFORI=XTODD:C$(I)=CHR$(RND(70)+32):NEXT:X=DD:GOTO10000
110 GOTO100
140 X=X+1:C$(X)=A$+STR$(130000-D)+LEFT$(M$,1)+STR$(P)
150 GOTO100
200 FORK=1TON:PRINTC$(K):NEXT:STOP:M=INT(D/10000):DY=INT((D-M*10000)/100):Y=1900+INT(D-DY*100-M*10000):PRINTT$",";TAB(10);MM$;M"-"DY"-"Y", PAGE";P:R$="ZZZZZ":RESTORE:U(U)=1:X=0:GOTO100
